#: ../../../specs/riscv-debug.rst:6
msgid "RISC-V Debug support for RISC-V CPUs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../specs/riscv-debug.rst:8
msgid ""
"Up until QEMU version 11.1 RISC-V CPUs historically supports Debug version "
"0.13 via a \"debug\" flag that is enabled by default in the default rv64 CPU."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../specs/riscv-debug.rst:12
msgid ""
"Starting on QEMU 11.2, RISC-V CPUs supports also Debug version 1.0, enabled "
"via the \"sdtrig\" flag like a regular extension.  The default setting for "
"rv64 is still Debug 0.13 (debug = on, sdtrig = off),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../specs/riscv-debug.rst:16
msgid ""
"The \"sdtrig\" flag precedes \"debug\", i.e. if both are enabled the CPU "
"will implement Debug 1.0.  In short:"
msgstr ""

